        "TileImage": "$($repository b9d970df-e189-41f7-87af-1e670ea5c364).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome 47,\r\rAmbrose Island is home to five targets whose fate is sealed. Silent, precise, and leaving no trace - the key to success lies in the art of seizing opportunities. Every environment holds possibilities, and those who know how to exploit them can make the inevitable seem like pure coincidence. Eliminate all five targets and disappear as if you were never there.\r\rGood Luck, Agent\r\r-blauball",
